          <briefdescription>
          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>Neterminal E je rozsah bez kroku (<ref refid="structExpr" kindref="compound">Expr</ref> * EXPR_RANGE vytvoreny pravidlem &quot;to&quot; nebo &quot;until&quot;), pripustny levy operand infixoveho &quot;by&quot; </para>
